{"id":"1a964fb64f0b73ff","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements.md","title":"ZFC Rel Compatible Elements","display":"df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements — ZFC Rel Compatible Elements","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements — ZFC Rel Compatible Elements","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements — ZFC Rel Compatible Elements"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q,P,\\leq\\in V\">\\(p,q,P,\\leq\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> 的规范定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S \\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S \\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}elements} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S(p,q,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq p\\land r\\leq q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}elements} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S(p,q,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq p\\land r\\leq q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在“较小即较强”的偏序约定下，相容性等价于存在共同加强；载体参数保证见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 属于同一偏序。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ 采用 [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] 的规范定义","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,q,P,\\leq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S \\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}elements} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelCompatibleElements}_S(p,q,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq p\\land r\\leq q)","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false}],"bytes":940,"backlinks":[{"id":"637302f53b9d5b15","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements.md|58-df-zfc-rel-compatible-elements]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}